  =
href=3D"https://sysbio.ioc.ee/projects/f2py2e/2.x/scipy_distutils-latest.=
win32.exe">scipy_distutils-latest.win32.exe</A>=20
  </LI></UL>
<P>Older releases are also available in the directories <A =
class=3Dreference=20
href=3D"https://sysbio.ioc.ee/projects/f2py2e/rel-0.x">rel-0.x</A>, <A=20
class=3Dreference=20
href=3D"https://sysbio.ioc.ee/projects/f2py2e/rel-1.x">rel-1.x</A>, <A=20
